      "notes": {
        "public": "",
        "value": "<h2>Printed Statblock</h2><p><strong>Hit Dice:</strong> 3d8+9 (21 hp)</p><p><strong>Initiative:</strong> +0</p><p><strong>Speed:</strong> 30 ft. (6 squares)</p><p><strong>Armor Class:</strong> 16 (+3 natural, +3 hide armor), touch 10, flat-footed 16</p><p><strong>Base Attack/Grapple:</strong> +3/+6</p><p><strong>Attack:</strong> Spear +6 melee (1d8+4/x3) or quills +6 melee (1d4+3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+3)</p><p><strong>Full Attack:</strong> Spear +6 melee (1d8+4/x3) or quills +6 melee (1d4+3) or javelin +3 ranged (1d6+3)</p><p><strong>Space/Reach:</strong> 5 ft./5 ft.</p><p><strong>Special Attacks:</strong> Pack fighting, quills</p><p><strong>Special Qualities:</strong> Darkvision 60 ft., scent</p><p><strong>Saves:</strong> Fort +6, Ref +1, Will +2</p><p><strong>Abilities:</strong> Str 16, Agy 10, Sta 17, Int 7, Spt 12, Cha 6</p><p><strong>Skills:</strong> Listen +3, Spot +3, Survival +5</p><p><strong>Feats:</strong> Great Fortitude, Power Attack</p><p><strong>Area:</strong> The Barrens</p><p><strong>Organization:</strong> Solitary, pair, pack (3-6) or den (10-100 plus 50% noncombatants plus one 5th-level hunter per 20 adults plus one 6th-8th level shaman) or warpack (5-10 2nd-level hunters plus 2-5 dire boars)</p><p><strong>Treasure:</strong> Standard</p><p><strong>Advancement:</strong> By character class</p><p><strong>Level Adjustment:</strong> +1</p><p><strong>Manual boundary:</strong> situational targeting, tactical decisions, and exceptional special abilities remain GM-adjudicated unless an embedded item provides a roll or effect.</p>"
